# UI

Signature: hover, focus, and active states paint a hard-edged selection rectangle, zero border-radius. Visible TTL decay hairline under each item. User content, timestamps, and pasted text in mono. Single dense column. Keyboard-first. ⌘K palette.

Palette: `--ink`, `--paper`, `--select`, `--select-ink`, `--rule`, `--decay`. Instrument Sans for UI. Martian Mono (or Commit Mono) for content.

Copy is dry and literal. "Copied." not "Copied to clipboard!". The cat lives in the app icon and the empty state only.

Forbidden: purple/blue gradients, glassmorphism, `rounded-3xl` cards, hero sections, feature grids with icons, Inter as the primary face, emoji in UI chrome, unrestyled shadcn.

```tsx
// BAD
<button className="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-500 to-blue-500">Share 🎉</button>

// GOOD
<button className="rounded-none bg-select text-select-ink">Copy</button>
```
